      "quoted": {
        "id": "2065328248330871206",
        "text": "YouMind 1.0 is officially here.\n\nThe loudest story about creating is a heavy one.\n\nMore discipline. More originality. More talent. More audience.\n\nSo that too many ideas stay saved, highlighted, half-written, but never become anything.\n\nBut that gets creation wrong.\n\nThe beginning was already there.\n\nIn what you saved. What you noticed. What you couldn’t stop thinking about.\n\nSo, in a moment when everyone is told to create better, we want to remind people what YouMind stands for:\n\nCreate bolder.",
